  "description": "The graffiti style font is an urban and expressive typeface that embodies the rebellious and vibrant nature of street art. Inspired by the bold and energetic brushstrokes found on city walls, this font captures the essence of graffiti culture.\nThe style of the graffiti font often incorporates various elements from street art culture. It may include arrows, stars, crowns, or other symbols commonly associated with graffiti. These elements further enhance the urban and edgy feel of the font, giving it a unique and recognizable identity.",
